% PDF/X settings for the print-ready A5 books (*_a5_print.pdf), read by Ghostscript in step5_build_pdfs.py.
% The inside pages are printed black and white (owner, 2026-10-31: cheaper; only the cover is in colour), so
% the content is converted to grey and no colour profile is embedded: the output intent names the
% registered print condition for uncoated paper, FOGRA52 (PSO Uncoated v3), which onlinedruck.ch asks for.
% Based on Ghostscript's lib/PDFX_def.ps.
[ /GTS_PDFXVersion (PDF/X-3:2002)
  /Trapped /False
/DOCINFO pdfmark
[/_objdef {OutputIntent_PDFX} /type /dict /OBJ pdfmark
[{OutputIntent_PDFX} <<
  /Type /OutputIntent
  /S /GTS_PDFX
  /OutputCondition (PSO Uncoated v3 \(FOGRA52\))
  /Info (PSO Uncoated v3 \(FOGRA52\))
  /OutputConditionIdentifier (FOGRA52)
  /RegistryName (http://www.color.org)
>> /PUT pdfmark
[{Catalog} <</OutputIntents [ {OutputIntent_PDFX} ]>> /PUT pdfmark
